{"answer":"You can request a GSTIN correction from the billing contact’s or an admin’s registered email. Invoices issued within the last 30 days are reissued within 2 business days; older invoices require a credit note and a new invoice. [BILL-1]

Refund eligibility depends on your billing plan: monthly plans have no refunds; annual plans allow a pro-rated refund if requested within 30 days of renewal. [BILL-2] Seat reductions take effect at the next annual renewal or the start of the next billing month. [SEAT-2]

What is the invoice date, and are you billed monthly or annually? If annually, when was your renewal?","policy_ids":["BILL-1","BILL-2","SEAT-2"],"decision":"inform"}
